19	 * Kept exactly as designed:
20	 *  - Choosing a service seeds a COMPLETE, working configuration, so the order is
21	 *    buyable without touching anything. Only free defaults are pre-set; nothing
22	 *    that adds to the total is ever ticked for you.
23	 *  - Once a service is picked nothing is gated — you can commit from anywhere.
24	 *  - This is deliberately NOT a <form>. On the live platform an unkeyed ternary
